{
  "an5.76:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 5.76 ",
  "an5.76:0.2": "8. Warriors ",
  "an5.76:0.3": "Warriors (2nd) ",
  "an5.76:1.1": "“Mendicants, these five warriors are found in the world. ",
  "an5.76:1.2": "What five? ",
  "an5.76:1.3": "Firstly, one warrior dons his sword and shield, fastens his bow and arrows, and plunges into the thick of battle. ",
  "an5.76:1.4": "He strives and struggles in the battle, ",
  "an5.76:1.5": "but his foes kill him and finish him off. ",
  "an5.76:1.6": "Some warriors are like that. ",
  "an5.76:1.7": "This is the first warrior found in the world. ",
  "an5.76:2.1": "Furthermore, one warrior dons his sword and shield, fastens his bow and arrows, and plunges into the thick of battle. ",
  "an5.76:2.2": "He strives and struggles in the battle, ",
  "an5.76:2.3": "but his foes wound him. ",
  "an5.76:2.4": "He’s carried off and taken to his relatives, ",
  "an5.76:2.5": "but he dies on the road before he reaches them. ",
  "an5.76:2.6": "Some warriors are like that. ",
  "an5.76:2.7": "This is the second warrior found in the world. ",
  "an5.76:3.1": "Furthermore, one warrior dons his sword and shield, fastens his bow and arrows, and plunges into the thick of battle. ",
  "an5.76:3.2": "He strives and struggles in the battle, ",
  "an5.76:3.3": "but his foes wound him. ",
  "an5.76:3.4": "He’s carried off and taken to his relatives, ",
  "an5.76:3.5": "who nurse him and care for him. ",
  "an5.76:3.6": "But he dies of his injuries while in their care. ",
  "an5.76:3.7": "S